<!-- People › Time & leave (design-people §1.2, §6, §7, §13 MyTime, Timesheets, TimesheetDetail and TimeEntries; impl-people P9, P10,
    F17, F57): the menu group of time and leave.
    P10 mounts Projects' time screens as they are (owner contract, design-projects §8 "Context passed"), each reading its context
    from the mount (appRoot People: its links, prints and terminal twin under People/Time) and checking what the user may do itself
    (mantle.work.TimesheetServices: a week's person, its approvers by the organization's policy, ADMIN; rates and amounts only with
    TIME_ENTRY_RATE, an employee's pay rate only with PAYROLL_VIEW). My time (the user's own week, or one they approve), Timesheets
    (the default: To approve for an approver, Mine otherwise; Missing with Remind) and Time entries are in the menu; TimesheetDetail,
    its print, the team timesheet, the terminal twin and the time import are opened from them. Every People user opens them through
    the root; a self-service employee without the launcher opens them by the area's own grant (BOSS_PPL_TIME), to keep and submit
    their own week.
    P9 builds Working schedules (Time/WorkingSchedules) with WorkingScheduleDetail opened from a row, and Holidays
    (Time/HolidayCalendars, HR's own editor here rather than in Settings, as the user's call of Nov 11 put HR's editors out of the
    People administrator's Settings): the working schedules HR's and the managers' (BOSS_PPL_SCHEDULES), Holidays HR's alone
    (BOSS_PPL_HOLIDAYS), both denied to the root user group and to self-service, and what each sees is what Mantle's
    ScheduleServices admit: the schedules of the employers an HR officer reads, those a manager's reports follow.
    P11 adds Leave balances (HR's and the managers', BOSS_PPL_LEAVE_BALANCES: an HR reader's employers' balances, a manager's
    reports'), and HR's Leave policies with LeavePolicyDetail and Allocations (BOSS_PPL_LEAVE; under Time rather than Settings, as
    Holidays), both denied to the root user group and to self-service (whose own balances are SelfService's), whose services are
    Mantle's LeaveServices. P12 adds Leave requests (menu 4, LeaveRequestDetail out of the menu) and the Team calendar (menu 6, with
    its terminal twin TeamCalendarTui), every People user's and a self-service employee's by this area's grant, whose services
    (LeaveServices find#, preview#, submit#, get# and decide#Request, get#TeamAbsences) admit each user to their own requests, their
    reports', those they decide and their employers' for HR. P13 adds Attendance (menu 8, every People user's and a self-service
    employee's by this area's grant: AttendanceServices find#Attendance, get#Day, request# and decide#Correction admit each user to their
    own days, their reports', those they decide and their employers' for HR; HR's Who clocks), the Clock in screen out of the menu (the
    quick create, the user's own clock) and HR's Time import out of the menu (BOSS_PPL_TIME_IMPORT). P14 adds the Shift roster (menu
    12, with its terminal twin ShiftRosterTui and its print ShiftRosterPrint out of the menu), HR's and the managers' with the working
    schedules (BOSS_PPL_SCHEDULES), whose services (ScheduleServices get#Roster, store#Shift and publish#Shifts) let a manager roster
    their reports and an HR editor their employers' employees. Hours for pay joins with P24. -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://moqui.org/xsd/xml-screen-3.xsd"
        default-menu-title="Time &amp; leave" default-menu-index="7" menu-image="sym_o_schedule" menu-image-type="icon">
    <subscreens default-item="Timesheets">
        <!-- P10's time screens, Projects' mounted; WorkingSchedules (menu index 5) and HolidayCalendars (9) are P9's files under Time/,
            with WorkingScheduleDetail out of the menu; P11: LeaveBalances (7), LeavePolicies (10) and LeaveAllocations (11), with
            LeavePolicyDetail out of the menu -->
        <subscreens-item name="Timesheets" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/Timesheets.xml" menu-title="Timesheets"
                menu-index="1"/>
        <subscreens-item name="MyTime" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/MyTime.xml" menu-title="My time" menu-index="2"/>
        <subscreens-item name="TimeEntries" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/TimeEntries.xml" menu-title="Time entries"
                menu-index="3"/>
        <subscreens-item name="TimesheetDetail" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/TimesheetDetail.xml" menu-include="false"/>
        <subscreens-item name="TimesheetPrint" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/TimesheetPrint.xml" menu-include="false"/>
        <subscreens-item name="TeamTimesheet" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/TeamTimesheet.xml" menu-include="false"/>
        <subscreens-item name="MyTimeTui" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/MyTimeTui.xml" menu-include="false"/>
        <subscreens-item name="Import" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/Import.xml" menu-include="false"/>
        <subscreens-item name="ImportProgress" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Time/ImportProgress.xml" menu-include="false"/>
    </subscreens>
    <widgets>
        <subscreens-active/>
    </widgets>
</screen>
